      "created_at": "2018-10-20T17:56:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey guys, just got my Oblivaeon order this week finally and I'm getting around to organizing it. I noticed in the first hero drawer, I was able to fit 17 hero decks, sleeved. I have 20 hero decks remaining and am wondering how exactly I'm supposed to fit the remaining 20 hero decks PLUS variant cards in the second drawer that's the same size. I thought they had tested the storage with sleeved cards, is that not the case or what?</p>",
